00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:27.200
The IRS is required to conduct audits of the
president and vice president while they're

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.260
in office.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.450
But Trump apparently got a pass.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.160
