supposed to be audited as a matter of automatic

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.870
principle.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.680
It's supposed to be mandatory audit of the
president.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:58.320
And as you zoom out, you find yet another
one of these projection hypocrisy logic pretzels

